  "implementation": [
    "Job Operation mints copyable JobPermit with shared Parent metadata and unique shared actor/live seal. Impl stores raw active seal only; no ownership cycle. Reuses same seal and rechecks after allocation/reentrant publication.",
    "Operation release-invalidates seal before clearing active scope and releasing JobScope. Copies never extend authority. check rejects wrong Parent/thread/expired before Parent gate, then validates exact live job seal/actor/PTD/root permission.",
    "Explicit Deques grow overload copies JobPermit into descriptor and validates before/after opaque checkpoints, before owner access and after checkpoint target retirement. Actual026670 uses existing authoritative typed Parent queues/maps.",
    "Default Deques grow/construction/close preserve original worker affinity. Public function parameter forwards by reference through helper into Call; after full field construction checkpoint.swap consumes every internal donor. Target retires while Growing/active before final permit/provider checks.",
    "JobHandoff.grow_output pins dispatch, Profile active call and exact child Parent scope; validates same source claim/session/control and selects only that session output.fields. Stable heap owners captured in checkpoint; no stack Call/Operation pointer retained.",
    "Growth changes capacity only: source job remains pending/claimed, no message body or closure/strong completion occurs. Environment/Graph/Policy and default InlineJobs unchanged."
  ],
